  "headline": "Antam Gold Price Increases To Rp2,505,000 Per Gram In Indonesia",
  "seoTitle": "Antam Gold Price Updates in Indonesia",
  "metaDescription": "The price of gold produced by PT Aneka Tambang Tbk has risen to Rp2,505,000 per gram on Monday, alongside an increase in the buyback rate.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Antam gold prices rose by Rp10,000 to reach Rp2,505,000 per gram on Monday, November 23, 2026.",
    "The official buyback price for Antam gold also saw an increase, climbing to Rp2,115,000 per gram.",
    "The current price shift follows a period of decline observed throughout the previous week, where prices had fallen below the Rp2.5 million mark."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The market for gold bullion in Indonesia has experienced price fluctuations over the last several days. Following a downward trend in mid-November 2026, which saw prices briefly dip below Rp2,500,000 per gram and triggered discussions regarding future market stability, prices have shown a slight recovery. On Monday, November 23, 2026, PT Aneka Tambang Tbk (Antam) reported an increase of Rp10,000 per gram. This adjustment affects both the primary selling price and the repurchase, or buyback, rate, which is now set at Rp2,115,000 per gram. Analysts and market observers continue to monitor these developments as gold remains a key commodity tracked alongside other national food and economic indicators. The current upward movement serves as a reversal of the volatility reported at the end of the previous week.",
